   "metadata": {},
   "source": ["# 🛩️ AeroLLM — Fine-tuning Llama 3.2 3B sur données ASRS\n", "**QLoRA fine-tuning sur Google Colab T4 GPU**"]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Vérification GPU\n",
